The base is 2.
The digits is a list of 1 and 0.
The exponent is 0.
For each digit in digits.
Set exponent to exponent times 10 plus digit.

The result is 1.
The reduced is base modulo 1337.
Repeat while exponent is more than 0.
Set result to result times reduced modulo 1337.
Subtract 1 from exponent.

Show result.
